@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #F0F0F0
skinparam componentStyle uml2

package "前端层（MVVM模式）" {
  [Web浏览器] as Browser
  [Vue.js应用] as VueApp
  [Arco Design组件库] as Arco
}

package "API网关层" {
  [Spring Cloud Gateway] as Gateway
}

package "微服务层（Spring Boot）" {
  [用户服务] as UserService
  [题目服务] as QuestionService
  [判题服务] as JudgeService
  [帖子服务] as PostService
  [文件服务] as FileService
  [题解服务] as SolutionService
  [评论服务] as CommentService
  [审核服务] as AuditService
}

package "数据存储层" {
  [MySQL] as MySQL
  [Redis] as Redis
  [MinIO文件存储] as MinIO
}

package "基础设施层" {
  [Docker容器] as Docker
  [RabbitMQ] as MQ
}

Browser --> VueApp : HTTP/HTTPS\n(组件交互)
VueApp --> Gateway : RESTful API\n(JSON/HTTPS)

Gateway --> UserService : HTTP/1.1
Gateway --> QuestionService : HTTP/2
Gateway --> JudgeService : gRPC
Gateway --> PostService : HTTP/1.1
Gateway --> FileService : HTTP/2
Gateway --> SolutionService : HTTP/1.1
Gateway --> CommentService : HTTP/2
Gateway --> AuditService : HTTP/1.1

UserService --> MySQL : 用户数据
QuestionService --> MySQL : 题目数据
PostService --> MySQL : 帖子数据
SolutionService --> MySQL : 题解数据
CommentService --> MySQL : 评论数据
AuditService --> MySQL : 审核日志

JudgeService --> Redis : 判题缓存
QuestionService --> Redis : 题目缓存
UserService --> Redis : 会话管理

FileService --> MinIO : 文件存储\n(S3协议)


JudgeService --> MQ : 判题任务队列\n(AMQP协议)
AuditService --> MQ : 审核事件订阅

Docker --> UserService : 容器化部署
K8S --> Docker : 调度管理


@enduml